do_2 = "Strengthen the existing regression at services/agent/crates/layerx-agentd/tests/proof_native_reads.rs:284 to require the exact fixed response for Unavailable, Verification and nested Connection(SequencerError::Rpc(RpcRefusal)) errors with distinctive message and data; rename it native_read_unavailable_has_fixed_body and assert that no internal variant, message or data is serialized."
do_3 = "Restore the code-only ErrorBody at services/agent/crates/layerx-agentd/tests/proof_serve_errors.rs:68 and replace the detail requirement in decode_response at :126 with strict rejection of extra fields, retaining deny_unknown_fields and all framing/status checks; strengthen verified_read_unavailable at :326 to assert exact body bytes from the real node through NativeReadRoute, the shared listener and TCP consumer, and add native_read_refusals_redact_internal_errors using the real NativeReadError classifier, HttpPool, parser and writer over TCP for nested RPC errors, checking both independent connections, exact 503 JSON and absence of diagnostic text without replacing a transport or constructing a wire response."
